---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Get a Quote"
seoTitle: "Get a Quote | adicot.com"
description: "Get a preliminary HVAC engineering fee in a minute. Most projects receive an instant estimate; larger or specialty work is scoped within 1-2 business days."
permalink: /quote.html
pageScript: quote.js
---
{#- base.njk rather than page.njk: page.njk prints one fixed h1 above the
    content, and this page's heading belongs to step 1 and is replaced on the
    result step. Options come from _data/quote.json, which is exported from the
    Flask repo by scripts/export_quote_options.py. -#}
<article class="quote">
<div class="quote-progress" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="quote-progress__fill" data-progress></div>
</div>

{% if quote.rates_are_placeholder %}
<p class="notice">
  <strong>Instant quoting is not live yet.</strong> The form works end to end, but any figure
  it shows is a placeholder, not a real fee. For a real quote please email
  <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> and we'll respond within
  1-2 business days.
</p>
{% endif %}

<p class="eyebrow" data-step-label>Step 1 of 2</p>

{# Page 1: the whole form. Project type comes first because the scope
   block below it swaps between the instant and custom field sets when a
   type is picked, and a revealed field has to appear below its trigger. #}
<div class="step is-active" data-step="form">
  <h1 class="h2">Get a preliminary fee.</h1>
  <p class="lede quote__body">Tell us the project type, the scope, and where to send it. Most
    projects receive a preliminary fee instantly. Very large or international projects route to a custom
    quote returned within 1-2 business days.</p>

  <div class="quote__group">
    <p class="eyebrow">1 · Project type</p>
    <h2>What kind of project is it?</h2>
    <p class="quote__body">Choose the category that best describes your project.</p>

    <p class="quote__pick">Select 1:</p>
    <div class="tiles">
      {%- for id, pt in quote.project_types %}
      <button type="button" class="tile" data-tile="project_type" data-value="{{ id }}"
              data-track="{{ pt.track }}">
        <span class="tile__title">{{ pt.title }}</span>
        <span class="tile__sub">{{ pt.subtitle }}</span>
      </button>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="quote__group">
    <p class="eyebrow">2 · Scope</p>
    <h2>Tell us about the scope.</h2>
    <p class="quote__body">A few details so we can price your project accurately. We'll only ask
      what we need to know.</p>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="project_name">Project name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <input id="project_name" name="project_name" type="text" placeholder="Dr Bermudez Dental"
             autocomplete="off" required aria-describedby="project_name-hint">
      <p class="hint" id="project_name-hint">Whatever you'd call this job. We use it to name the project file.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="address">Project address <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <input id="address" name="address" type="text" placeholder="123 Main St, Springfield"
             autocomplete="street-address" required aria-describedby="address-hint">
      <p class="hint" id="address-hint">Street address of the project site.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="state">Jurisdiction <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <select id="state" name="state" required>
        <option value="" selected>Select a state</option>
        {%- for j in quote.jurisdictions %}
        {%- if j[0] == '---' %}
        <option disabled>{{ j[1] }}</option>
        {%- else %}
        <option value="{{ j[0] }}">{{ j[1] }}</option>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>

    {# Instant-track fields. Hidden when a custom-track project type is picked. #}
    <div data-scope="instant">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="sqft">Square Footage <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input id="sqft" name="square_footage" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="12,625"
               autocomplete="off" required aria-describedby="sqft-hint">
        <p class="hint" id="sqft-hint">Conditioned area for design jobs</p>
      </div>

      <p class="quote__label">What service do you need? <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></p>
      <p class="quote__pick">Select one or both:</p>
      {# data-multi makes quote.js treat this group as a toggle rather than
         a radio. Ordering both adds the two fees together. #}
      <div class="tiles" data-multi>
        {%- for id, sv in quote.services %}
        <button type="button" class="tile" data-tile="services" data-value="{{ id }}"
                aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="tile__title">{{ sv.title }}</span>
          <span class="tile__sub">{{ sv.subtitle }}</span>
        </button>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Custom-track field. Revealed by a custom project type or a server reroute. #}
    <div data-scope="custom" hidden>
      <p class="notice quote__notice" data-reason hidden></p>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="description">Tell us about the project <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <textarea id="description" name="description" rows="6" required aria-describedby="description-hint"
                  placeholder="Describe the project, the issue, or what you need help with. Photos and documents can be attached below."></textarea>
        <p class="hint" id="description-hint">Provide a brief description of your project</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="quote__group">
    <p class="eyebrow">3 · Your details</p>
    <h2>How can we reach you?</h2>
    <p class="quote__body">We'll send your quote and any follow-up details to the contact info
      you provide. Your information stays with Adicot. We don't share leads.</p>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="name">Your Name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First and last name"
             autocomplete="name" required>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="email">Email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@company.com"
             autocomplete="email" required>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="company">Company or Firm</label>
      <input id="company" name="company" type="text"
             placeholder="Your firm or organization" autocomplete="organization">
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="notes">Anything else we should know</label>
      <textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="4"
                placeholder="Drawings status, deadlines, preferred contact times, etc."></textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="files">Upload plans or specifications <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
      <input id="files" name="files" type="file" multiple>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
    <label for="website">Leave this field empty</label>
    <input id="website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  </p>

  <p class="quote__error" data-error hidden>*Please complete all required fields.</p>
  <p class="form-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-submit>Get My Estimate &rarr;</button>
  </p>

  {# Submitting writes a sheet row, builds the Drive tree and files the
     uploads, which can run close to a minute. Shown for that whole wait. #}
  <div class="working" data-working hidden aria-live="polite">
    <div class="working__bar"><div class="working__fill" data-working-fill></div></div>
    <p class="working__text" data-working-text></p>
    <p class="muted">This can take up to a minute. Please keep this page open.</p>
  </div>
</div>

{# Page 2: the result. Estimate and confirmation in one panel. #}
<div class="step" data-step="result">
  <p class="eyebrow">Inquiry received</p>
  <h2 class="h2">Thank you. We have your inquiry.</h2>
  <p class="lede quote__body" data-done-body></p>

  <div data-result="instant" hidden>
    <div class="estimate">
      <p class="eyebrow">Preliminary Estimate</p>
      <p class="estimate__amount" data-total>$0</p>
      <p class="muted">Valid for 30 Days. Preliminary estimate based on the scope you provided</p>
    </div>

    <p class="notice quote__notice" data-license-notice hidden></p>

    <h3 class="summary__head">Fee Breakdown</h3>
    <dl class="summary">
      <div class="summary__row"><dt>Base Fee</dt><dd data-fee="base_and_sf"></dd></div>
      {# Only shown when the jurisdiction needs a new license, so the client
         never sees a $0 line for a fee that does not apply to them. #}
      <div class="summary__row" data-needs-license hidden>
        <dt>Out-of-State License</dt><dd data-fee="license_surcharge"></dd>
      </div>
      <div class="summary__row summary__row--total"><dt>Total</dt><dd data-fee="total_fee"></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <p class="quote__body"><strong>What happens next:</strong> We will review your inquiry and any
      documents you've shared, then confirm your final fee. If your project scope is more complex
      than the form captured, we may suggest adjustments. You'll always have the option to accept,
      decline, or discuss.</p>
    <p class="muted">This estimate is preliminary and is not a commitment. We'll be in touch
      within 1-2 business days. Final scope and fee are confirmed in writing before work begins. You can also
      contact us through Email at: <strong><a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a></strong></p>
  </div>

  <div data-result="custom" hidden>
    <h3>Your project deserves a custom quote.</h3>
    <p class="quote__body">Some projects (very large buildings and work outside the U.S.) need a
      closer look before we can give you an accurate fee.</p>
    <p class="notice quote__notice" data-reason hidden></p>

    <p class="quote__body"><strong>What happens next:</strong> We will personally review your
      inquiry and respond within 1-2 business days with a scoped quote, an estimated turnaround,
      and any clarifying questions. No obligation. Submitting just starts the conversation.</p>
    <p class="muted">Submitting is not a commitment. We'll be in touch within 1-2 business
      days. Final scope and fee are confirmed in writing before work begins.</p>
  </div>

  <h3 class="summary__head">Scope Summary</h3>
  <dl class="summary">
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Name</dt><dd data-sum="name"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Email</dt><dd data-sum="email"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Project Address</dt><dd data-sum="address"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Project Type</dt><dd data-sum="project_type"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row" data-only="instant"><dt>Services</dt><dd data-sum="services"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row" data-only="instant"><dt>Square Footage</dt><dd data-sum="square_footage"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd data-sum="state"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row" data-only="custom"><dt>Project Description</dt><dd data-sum="description"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>File name(s)</dt><dd data-sum="files"></dd></div>
    <div class="summary__row"><dt>Project Notes</dt><dd data-sum="notes"></dd></div>
  </dl>

  <p class="quote__body">Our team has your inquiry and will contact you within 1-2 business
    days. If it's urgent, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> directly.</p>

  <p class="form-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/">&larr; Back to home</a>
  </p>
</div>
</article>
